|-----------|-------|
| "Remember this for Dev OS" | user-memory add_observations |
| "What's the latest Next.js cache API?" | Exa search → cite sources |
| "Open example.com and click Sign in" | browser navigate → snapshot → click |
| "Clone landing page X" | clone-website + browser screenshots |
| "Fix failing GitHub check" | ci-investigator or shell + fix-ci skill |
| "Rename function foo across repo" | gitnexus_impact → gitnexus_rename |
| "Refresh hub from new repos" | SYSTEM-TAXONOMY + foundation-refresh.md |
| "Marketing copy like an agency" | agency-agents persona + marketingskills |
| "SEO audit full stack" | seo-audit.ps1 + seo-geo on-page + technical |
| "P2 refresh" | commands/p2-refresh.ps1 |
| "Prompt lesson" | prompt-engineering-coach → prompt-lessons/ |
| "Grill me / согласовать план" | grill-rounds (clarify-first) |
| "Новый проект с нуля" | wayfinder → WBS (from-scratch) |
| "Глоссарий CONTEXT.md" | project-context (client repo only) |
| "собери композицию remotion" | remotion-code + remotion-adapter (не production-studio) |
